---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
---

<Layout
  title="Website Privacy — Unit Alfa"
  description="How this Unit Alfa website handles enquiry drafts, email, drawing attachments and optional Google Maps and YouTube content."
>
  <PageIntro
    label="WEBSITE INFORMATION"
    title="PRIVACY."
    intro="This notice describes how the website currently works. Updated 21 September 2026."
  />
  <article class="container legal-copy section-bottom">
    <h2>Enquiry drafts</h2>
    <p>
      The enquiry form prepares a draft in your browser. It does not submit your entries to a Unit
      Alfa website server, upload files or save the draft in browser storage. Opening your email app
      transfers the prepared text to that app. Copying or downloading the draft takes place only
      when you select that action.
    </p>
    <h2>Email and drawings</h2>
    <p>
      When you send an email, your contact details, message and attachments are handled by your
      email provider and the recipient’s provider. Share only information needed for the enquiry. If
      a drawing needs confidentiality arrangements, contact Unit Alfa before sending it. Ask Unit
      Alfa directly about retention or deletion of emailed enquiries.
    </p>
    <h2>Maps, video and external links</h2>
    <p>
      The Google map and YouTube player load only when you choose to load them. Those services
      receive technical information such as your IP address and may use cookies or other storage
      under their own policies. External links open third-party services with their own terms.
    </p>
    <h2>Opening animation</h2>
    <p>
      A temporary tab-session flag remembers that the opening logo animation has played, so it does
      not repeat as you navigate. It contains no enquiry details or personal information. The
      introduction is skipped when reduced motion is enabled or session storage is unavailable.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not include an advertising tracker or an application analytics script. The
      hosting platform may process access and security logs. A private preview may require the
      hosting platform’s sign-in; its account and privacy settings apply to that access.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about an enquiry, email <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a>{' '}
      or contact Unit Alfa at {company.address}.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
